+<?xml version="1.0"?>
+
+<!-- custom: adding our own AdvCiv-SAS knobs so that players or me xd but anyways etc can tweak/modify them without having to recompile each time which is tedious anyways etc; general warning: do not put weird values like negative or very big ones, i didn't put any safeguard about this as is tedious and needless, as long as value is sane and around reasonably expected values should be fine, if in doubt ask in forum or such although i may not always be available to reply but maybe someone else might in that case maybe (i don't know i mean but anyways etc) or/and check in code of relevant function(s) anyways etc -->
